This project uses Kubernetes API definitions, apimachinery and client-go,
which are licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

YAML parsing uses go.yaml.in/yaml/v3 and sigs.k8s.io/yaml. Dependency versions
and their transitive modules are recorded in go.mod and go.sum. Each dependency
retains its own copyright and license. Release packages include dependency
license texts generated from the exact module graph.

Authorization behavior is implemented against the Kubernetes RBAC semantics
and verified against the Kubernetes API server. Upstream references are listed
in docs/design.zh-CN.md.
